title: config:open
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Customising the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Open the settings panel in the focused slot

Shows the [[config panel]] in the focused slot, like `panel:open here config`: the paths of the configuration files, with buttons that reload the keybindings and the style sheet, and the keybinding editor ([[Changing keybindings]]). See [[Customising the GUI]].
